            "newString": "---\ntitle: Documentation\ndescription: Generate AI-friendly SKILL.md files from your Storybook components\n---\n\nimport { Card, CardGrid } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';\n\n## What is Storybook to SKILL.md?\n\n`storybook-to-skills-md` is a CLI tool that automatically generates [SKILL.md](https://agentskills.io) files from your Storybook components. These files provide AI agents with structured knowledge about your components, enabling them to use your design system effectively.\n\n## Why Use This Tool?\n\n<CardGrid stagger>\n\t<Card title=\"Automated Documentation\" icon=\"rocket\">\n\t\tGenerate component docs automatically from Storybook stories with zero manual work.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"AI-Friendly Format\" icon=\"star\">\n\t\tOptimized for AI agent consumption following the agentskills.io specification.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"Always Up-to-Date\" icon=\"refresh\">\n\t\tRegenerate on every change using smart caching to keep docs in sync.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"Multiple LLM Providers\" icon=\"puzzle\">\n\t\tChoose from OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google AI based on your needs.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"Offline Mode\" icon=\"laptop\">\n\t\tWork with local Storybook builds - no deployment required.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"CI/CD Ready\" icon=\"github\">\n\t\tGitHub Action available for automated generation in your pipeline.\n\t</Card>\n</CardGrid>\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the CLI globally:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g @sergiocarracedo/storybook-to-skills-md\n```\n\nGenerate SKILL.md files from your Storybook:\n\n```bash\nstorybook-to-skills-md generate \\\n  --storybook-url https://your-storybook.com \\\n  --source-dir ./src/components \\\n  --output-dir ./skills \\\n  --provider openai \\\n  --model gpt-4o \\\n  --api-key sk-your-api-key\n```\n\n## What Gets Generated?\n\nEach component gets its own `SKILL.md` file with:\n- Component description and purpose\n- Props/API documentation\n- Usage examples from Storybook stories\n- Implementation guidelines\n- Links to your Storybook\n\n## Next Steps\n\n<CardGrid>\n\t<Card title=\"Installation\" icon=\"add-document\">\n\t\t[Install the CLI](/getting-started/installation) and set up your environment.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"Quick Start\" icon=\"rocket\">\n\t\t[Generate your first files](/getting-started/quick-start) in minutes.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"CLI Reference\" icon=\"setting\">\n\t\tExplore all [commands and options](/cli/commands) available.\n\t</Card>\n\t<Card title=\"LLM Providers\" icon=\"puzzle\">\n\t\tLearn about [supported providers](/providers/overview) and how to configure them.\n\t</Card>\n</CardGrid>",
